boot-repair-legacy (0.2.25-etch1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Legacy Boot Bitch frontend for Debian 4.0 (Etch) / KDE 3.5-era systems:
    the Qt3 GUI (boot-repair-legacy-gui) renders the helper's read-only
    device inventory and Repair tool capability lines, greys unavailable
    tools with their probe reason and only enables the legacy-supported
    commands; the gksu/dialog launcher stays installed as the no-X fallback.
  * The ported boot-repair-legacy-helper keeps the modern command surface and
    the Repair tool / Repair change status evidence contract on bash 3.1 and
    pre-systemd userlands.

 -- CaptainMorgan12 <CaptainMorgan12@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
